<title>USA: WEEKLY NOPA SOYBEAN CRUSH TRADE ESTIMATES.</title>
<headline>WEEKLY NOPA SOYBEAN CRUSH TRADE ESTIMATES.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the National Oilseed Processors Association (NOPA) weekly U.S. soybean crush were as follows (in million bushels).</p>
<p>NOPA will release the data at 0730 CDT Friday.</p>
<p>    Estimate range    Week ago actual  Two weeks ago</p>
<p>     22.00-24.20	    23.577	     23.891</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
